# DISA's published STIG content must stay BYTE-IDENTICAL to what was downloaded
# from cyber.mil. Git's CRLF normalisation silently stripped 34 CR bytes from
# the V1R6 XCCDF (658177 -> 658143), which parses fine but no longer matches
# DISA's published file if anyone hashes it for provenance.
*Manual-xccdf.xml -text -diff
*.cklb -text
*.ckl  -text
